This plugin ports the provider request/response contracts from the
Hermes web search plugin.

Source: https://github.com/robbyczgw-cla/hermes-web-search-plus
Copyright (c) robbyczgw-cla  -  licensed under the MIT License.
Bundled verbatim here as LICENSE-MIT; the Pantheon adaptations are
marked in run.py's header.

The upstream project (~24k lines: agent orchestration, caching,
budgeting, dashboards) was NOT vendored  -  only its provider contracts
(endpoints, authentication headers, response shapes, and the SSRF-guard
posture of its extract path) were ported, rewritten as a lean stdlib
Pantheon tool runner.
